    <panel_attributes>title=SD15 (new): F17 AI monthly review with proposed budgets
obj=User~u ACTOR
obj=:ReportView~v
obj=:MapleCfoFacade~f
obj=:MonthlyReviewService~m
obj=:CfoAgent~a
obj=:LlmClient~l
obj=:ToolRegistry~r
obj=:PendingActionStore~p
obj=:CommandHistory~h
u-&gt;v : AI review &amp; next month's budgets
v-&gt;f : runMonthlyReview(month)
f-&gt;m : review(month)
m-&gt;a : runTask(instruction, maxSteps=10)
a-&gt;l : chat(instruction, tool schemas)
l.&gt;a : tool calls: spending_summary, budget_status, suggest_budgets
a-&gt;r : execute(each call)
r.&gt;a : results (figures from Java)
a-&gt;l : chat(+ tool results)
l.&gt;a : propose_action(set_budget, category, amount, month) x up to 5
a-&gt;r : execute(propose_action)
r-&gt;p : add(SetBudgetCommand)
p.&gt;r : action id
a-&gt;l : chat(+ results)
l.&gt;a : review text with to-do list
a.&gt;m : AgentResponse (every amount checked against tool results)
m.&gt;f : MonthlyReview(text, proposals)
f.&gt;v : MonthlyReview
v.&gt;u : review + Confirm / Dismiss per budget
u-&gt;v : Confirm
v-&gt;f : confirmProposedAction(id)
f-&gt;p : take(id)
f-&gt;h : run(SetBudgetCommand)  (undoable)</panel_attributes>
